      "text_tajweed_html": "وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ذْكُرِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>سْمَ رَبِّكَ وَتَبَتَّلْ إِلَيْهِ تَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>تِيلاً <span class=end>٨</span>"
