    {
      "ayah_number": 9,
      "text_tajweed_html": "رَّبُّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَشْرِقِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَغْرِبِ ل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَ إِلَّا هُوَ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّخِذْهُ وَكِيلاً <span class=end>٩</span>"
